  "notes": "The top camera guard now affects only members in the exact voice room you are currently in.\n\nThe guard follows you automatically when you move to another voice room and scans that room for cameras already enabled.\n\nWhen you are outside voice, the option stays enabled but does not disconnect anyone in other rooms.\n\nValidation passed: TypeScript, ESLint, production build, installer tests, packaged ASAR hashing, and release asset verification."
